          "gu_swirl_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Iceblade storm is formed by Iceblade Gu, Swirl Gu, and Fierce Wind Gu. Used together, the three create a move that can attack and defend; without two or more defense Gu working together, a target cannot resist it.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "iceblade-storm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_ice_blade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The storm starts as a small gust, then expands into roaring icy winds and a blizzard that coats the floor in hard ice. Fierce winds and ice blades freeze what they hit, and the white storm presses on like a huge beast. The same stretch calls the move hard to display or stop cleanly.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "iceblade-storm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cited chapters that name Fierce Wind Gu do not describe a solo activation effect apart from that joint use.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
